<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYMOVIE "山桜夜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPD TIME="4294967246">Long ago, there were those who fled to this land. 
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
This paradise was named Arata.
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\平治の乱.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Those enchanted by the fruit of Eden in this land joined the ranks of history, 
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
and vanish―
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "血と砂と鋼鉄.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\蔵本乱雑.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"There is someone I want to protect. 
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
Even I, who am of no use to anyone, have a way to protect them."
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島たこ焼き.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\エデン\たこしゃぶ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "540" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"See, if you boil it properly, it turns red. </STYLE>
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">Some things only become visible once they've been through the fire."</STYLE>
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ワゴン昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm asking just to be sure. Are you really going to Arata?"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'm definitely going! There's something only I can do, so I'm definitely going!"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm going too!"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">"No way I could go home and leave these guys behind either!"</STYLE><BR>
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "eden3.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This is... 
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
Shigatsu Youka...
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
